cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and cite Le Verrier (1846) for the
  observations themselves.
type: dataset
title: "Le Verrier (1846), Table n° 77: 279 observations of Uranus, 1690–1845, transcribed and reconciled"
version: 1.0.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24044792
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24044792
    description: "Zenodo record of this dataset, version 1.0.0"
# date-released: 2026-MM-DD
authors:
  - family-names: Pahadiya
    given-names: Atishay
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-1264-1662"
license: CC0-1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/atishaypahadiya/neptune-fork"
abstract: >-
  Transcription of Table n° 77 of U. J. Le Verrier's memoir on the motion of Uranus
  (Connaissance des Temps pour 1849, Additions, pp. 129–136, Paris 1846): 279 observed
  apparent right ascensions and declinations of Uranus, 1690–1845, with Le Verrier's computed
  values and his computed-minus-observed residuals in RA, Dec, longitude and latitude. Every
  cell is kept exactly as printed. The package also contains the two independent
  transcription passes, the resolution log for their 14 disagreements (resolved against a
  third printing), a table of 7 misprints in the source with the argument for each, a
  28-row spot-check records, and a derived file of 529 measurements in degrees with Julian
  Dates. The transcription and reconciliation were done by an AI model,
  not by an independent human. The dataset was then spot-checked by a human against the Gallica scan (28 rows, 336 cells, 0 discrepancies), by the dataset author.
keywords:
  - Le Verrier
  - Uranus
  - Neptune
  - history of astronomy
  - astrometry
  - historical observations
  - meridian observations
  - Connaissance des Temps
  - transcription
  - celestial mechanics
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Recherches sur les mouvements de la planète Herschel (dite Uranus)"
    authors:
      - family-names: Le Verrier
        given-names: Urbain Jean Joseph
    journal: "Connaissance des Temps pour l'an 1849, Additions"
    year: 1846
    start: 3
    end: 254
    publisher:
      name: Bachelier
    location:
      name: Paris
